[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11280.23, "timestamp": "03:08:00", "text": "導管。泳ぎ方って、もう一度覚えてますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11283.99, "timestamp": "03:08:03", "text": "ダブルクリック。 W."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11286.15, "timestamp": "03:08:06", "text": "ああ、ダブルタップ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11288.63, "timestamp": "03:08:08", "text": "これはどのMinecraftサーバーですか？ようこそ、ハシさん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11291.67, "timestamp": "03:08:11", "text": "えっと、こちらはクリッサSMPです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11293.99, "timestamp": "03:08:13", "text": "ええ、ずっと昔の話です。ずっと昔から。の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11296.71, "timestamp": "03:08:16", "text": "クリスSMPを台無しにした。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11298.389, "timestamp": "03:08:18", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11302.79, "timestamp": "03:08:22", "text": "これは最初のマイクロサーバーでした"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11308.52, "timestamp": "03:08:28", "text": "えっと、ほとんどの人が私をプレイした"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11309.91, "timestamp": "03:08:29", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11315.99, "timestamp": "03:08:35", "text": "それから、ヒカリスが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11317.59, "timestamp": "03:08:37", "text": "うん"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11320.71, "timestamp": "03:08:40", "text": "それから、えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11322.63, "timestamp": "03:08:42", "text": "それからそれからそれから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11326.95, "timestamp": "03:08:46", "text": "えっと、他に誰がいるの？ええと、ネコアミは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11329.03, "timestamp": "03:08:49", "text": "うん、ネカミ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11331.19, "timestamp": "03:08:51", "text": "私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11334.79, "timestamp": "03:08:54", "text": "えっと、あ、待って。彼女の名前を忘れてしまった。えっと、これ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11338.23, "timestamp": "03:08:58", "text": "覚えていますか？待って、忘れてた"}]